{
 "format": "pcbpro",
 "version": 1,
 "name": "EL84 18W Push-Pull",
 "author": "",
 "revision": "A",
 "notes": "18 W EL84 push-pull amp: 12AX7 gain stages, DC-coupled cathode follower into a Marshall-style tone stack, 12AX7 cathodyne phase inverter, cathode-biased EL84 pair (150R shared), EZ81 rectifier.\nPower transformer 260-0-260 VAC 120 mA, 6.3 V 3.5 A (EZ81 heater on the same winding); output transformer 8k a-a to the speaker. Mains wiring stays on the chassis.\nB+1 ~340 V. Never use EL84 pins 1, 6 or 8 as tie points.",
